{
  "date": "2025-07-21",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 와써어",
      "en": "I'm back~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "일본 모든일정이 끝난건 아니지만 그래도 일본콘 무사히 잘 마쳐서 다행이야ㅑ",
      "en": "Not all of our Japan schedules are over yet, but I'm really glad we finished the Japan concerts safely."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "웅 나도 멤버들이랑",
      "en": "Yep, I also went"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "놀이공원 다녀왔는데",
      "en": "to an amusement park with the members."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 맛있는 타코야끼를 판다는거야",
      "en": "They said there was a place that sold really delicious takoyaki."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 타코야끼가 더 중요했어서 놀이기구는 신경쓰지 못했어",
      "en": "The takoyaki was more important to me, so I didn't really pay attention to the rides."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅎㅎ",
      "en": "ㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 넘 맛있었어",
      "en": "It was seriously so good."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "명랑치즈랑 에그마요 타코야끼",
      "en": "Pollock roe cheese and egg mayo takoyaki."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "명란",
      "en": "Pollock roe."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 무대 실력이 더 좋아진 것 같아요ㅋㅋ르ㅋ르크",
      "en": "I think your stage skills have gotten even better. ㅋㅋ르ㅋ르크"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 좋아",
      "en": "I love hearing that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요즘 이말을 많이 들어서 기분이 너무좋아",
      "en": "I've been hearing that a lot lately, so it makes me really happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "뭔가 힘이 생겼어",
      "en": "It feels like you've gained a new kind of strength."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그거 잘먹어서 그럼",
      "en": "That's because I ate well."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "투어때 늘어온게 크긴한데",
      "en": "I definitely improved a lot during the tour,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔가 계속 추다보니까",
      "en": "but after performing over and over,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이젠 틀릴까봐 생각하면서 추는게 사라져서",
      "en": "I stopped dancing while worrying about making mistakes,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "더 잘해보일수도 있을것같음",
      "en": "so maybe that's why I seem better now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 아직",
      "en": "But still..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아직이야..",
      "en": "I'm not there yet..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘해보이는것보다",
      "en": "Rather than just looking good,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘해야지",
      "en": "I want to actually be good."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연님 라이브 계획 잇으신가요",
