    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "전에 일본 왔을때 처음 꼈어서",
      "en": "The first time I wore them was the last time I came to Japan,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "살짝 서사느낌으로",
